# The plan model

Sam contrasts Alchemy's earlier await-based model with a plan model. He says Alchemy v2 adopted output values that can connect to other resources before deployment. The engine can show the plan before those values become readable at deployment. [Sam Goodwin on Alchemy, 26:00](https://youtu.be/MtKHzAH6uXM?t=1560).

He also connects Effect purity with a reviewable plan and a concrete deployment result. [Happy Path 116, 12:22](https://youtu.be/YEn4A7XxgF4?t=742).

See [Sam Goodwin on Alchemy](/lore/devtools-fm-sam-goodwin-alchemy) and [Happy Path 116](/lore/happy-path-116-infrastructure-as-effects-sam-goodwin).
